# GNIRS CC crate (gnirscc). Same reasoning as the GMOS entry above: boot flags
# 0x8 with a blank ftp password mean the kernel AND its vxWorks.sym come over
# rsh, and 10.2.2.87 has a PTR record (mkognirscc-ap1.hi.gemini.edu), so the IP
# literal alone is not sufficient for ruserok(). It does NOT need /gemdata:
# nothing in gnirscc or the IS uses it.
10.2.2.87 gemvx
mkognirscc-ap1.hi.gemini.edu gemvx
mkognirscc-ap1 gemvx
